      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Research Data Management (RDM) is vital for researchers to ensure the proper organisation of research data along the entire life cycle from creation to preservation, including their sharing as open data (FAIR data).\n\nSessions cover the following topics:\n\nThe ETH Research Data Management Summer School takes place from 4 June to 7 June 2019 in the ETH Alumni Pavillon. Doctoral students can obtain 2 ECTS points.\n\nMore information on the ETH RDM Summer School"
